#, fuzzy
#~| msgid ""
#~| "Many digital cameras support taking of short movie clips. These clips "
#~| "are usually stored in AVI or MPEG format. &digikam; understands these "
#~| "formats and will generate thumbnails for the movie files. However, "
#~| "&digikam; is not a movie editing application and it does not have any "
#~| "built-in movie viewing or editing capabilities. If you double click on a "
#~| "movie file &digikam; will use your &kde; settings to choose a viewing "
#~| "application to use."
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Many digital cameras support taking of short movie clips. These clips are "
#~ "usually stored in AVI or MP4 format. &digikam; understands these formats "
#~ "and will generate thumbnails for the movie files. However, &digikam; is "
#~ "not a movie editing application and it does not have any built-in movie "
#~ "viewing or editing capabilities. If you double click on a movie file "
#~ "&digikam; you can preview video or choose a viewing application through "
#~ "your desktop settings."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Mnogo digitalnih kamera podrzava pravljenje malih klipova(videa). Ovi "
#~ "klipovi su obicno pohranjeni u AVI ili MPEG formatu. &digikam; "
#~ "podrazumijeva ove dormate i generisati ce prikaz za te fajlove. Kako "
#~ "god,  &digikam;  nije edior videa i nema niti jedno moguce prikazivanje "
#~ "filma ili mogucnosti uredjivanja. Ako dva puta kliknete na datoteku filma "
#~ "&digikam; ce iskoristiti &kde; postavke za biranje aplikacije, koja ce "
#~ "omoguciti pregledanje."
